            <ArticleTitle>The Biopolitics of Lifestyle: Foucault, Ethics and Healthy Choices : Christopher Mayes, 2016, Routledge (Oxford and New York, 978-1-138-93386-6, 156 pp.).</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
